49
00:04:52,940 --> 00:04:56,740
It only took a single thrust to that boar's heart.

50
00:04:56,740 --> 00:05:02,700
Meanwhile, that yellow-haired boy is trapped under the rubble, so I think I'll leave him there

51
00:05:02,700 --> 00:05:06,160
until he dies, squirming around like an insect.

52
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:08,120
