68
00:05:55,900 --> 00:06:00,300
So if I went for his head now, I couldn't slash it.

69
00:06:00,300 --> 00:06:04,260
The girl in the box... is my younger sister.

70
00:06:11,260 --> 00:06:13,060
It's just as I thought then.

71
00:06:13,060 --> 00:06:15,060
You really are a disgrace, huh?

72
00:06:15,060 --> 00:06:18,640
Imagine being so useless you can't protect your own sister.

73
00:06:20,260 --> 00:06:22,460
Well, I guess it can't be helped.

74
00:06:22,460 --> 00:06:24,140
After all, you're just human.

75
00:06:24,140 --> 00:06:26,260
It makes sense you're weaker than your sister.

76
00:06:26,260 --> 00:06:30,260
Considering she's a demon, it only makes sense she's stronger than you.

77
00:06:30,260 --> 00:06:33,260
Even so, I just can't help but see you as a disgrace.

78
00:06:33,260 --> 00:06:41,020
If you're really her big brother, then you should be protecting her instead of leaving her to fight all of your battles for you, you coward.

79
00:06:41,020 --> 00:06:42,020
Devotedly.

80
00:06:42,020 --> 00:06:44,020
With this hand, you see?

81
00:06:44,020 --> 00:06:54,020
But I've got to know, how do you feel after all this?

82
00:06:54,020 --> 00:06:57,020
Being the only one to survive so disgracefully.

83
00:06:57,020 --> 00:07:03,780
Not to mention you let that kid sister of yours use up her strength protecting a disgrace like you.

84
00:07:03,780 --> 00:07:05,780
Hey, answer me, worm.

85
00:07:05,780 --> 00:07:07,780
You imbecile.

86
00:07:07,780 --> 00:07:08,780
Sad sack.

87
00:07:08,780 --> 00:07:09,780
Coward.

88
00:07:09,780 --> 00:07:10,780
Good for nothing.

89
00:07:10,780 --> 00:07:13,780
Why was trash like you even born to begin with?

90
00:07:13,780 --> 00:07:15,780
What are you gonna do?

91
00:07:15,780 --> 00:07:23,540
I don't know about you, but I'd love to see you try and cut off my head with that useless, battered, disgraceful human body of yours.

92
00:07:23,540 --> 00:07:24,540
Come on!

93
00:07:24,540 --> 00:07:25,540
Come on!

94
00:07:25,540 --> 00:07:26,540
Come on!

95
00:07:26,540 --> 00:07:48,300
Come on!

96
00:07:48,300 --> 00:07:52,780
Oh, I see. Your poor little soul got crushed at the last second, huh?

97
00:07:52,960 --> 00:07:57,220
How disgraceful are you? I didn't think you could get more pathetic.

98
00:07:57,220 --> 00:08:18,880
I gotta hand it to you. You really are the most disgraceful scumbag.

99
00:08:19,580 --> 00:08:24,120
In all my life, I've never seen anyone as shameless or cowardly as you.

100
00:08:27,220 --> 00:08:57,200
Oh, I can't help you.

101
00:08:57,200 --> 00:09:00,380
Anything that's pathetic, disgraceful, and filthy, you understand?

102
00:09:01,580 --> 00:09:08,260
What is it about you? Maybe it's this filthy scar on your forehead I'm getting attached to.

103
00:09:09,160 --> 00:09:12,800
I have an idea. How about you just become a demon, too?

104
00:09:13,020 --> 00:09:17,040
Why not do it for your little sister's sake? Oh, why couldn't I have thought of that sooner?

105
00:09:17,540 --> 00:09:21,960
If you become a demon, I'll spare your life, since you and I will be comrades then.

106
00:09:22,380 --> 00:09:29,060
